{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"STV"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)SCCellActions(py)calculatedValue","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"calculatedValue","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"calculatedValue","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"calculatedValue"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCCellActions\/calculatedValue","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCCellActions"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Action is used to provide a value for calculated cells.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/stv\/sccellactions\/calculatedvalue"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"copy","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SCCellCalculatedValueAction_Block","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:SCCellActions.h@T@SCCellCalculatedValueAction_Block","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCCellCalculatedValueAction_Block"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"calculatedValue","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Cells implementing this action are typically calculated cells that do not have their own values in the data store and depend on this action to provide a value. The return value is typically a mathematical operation on serveral other boundObject properties. For a more elaborate example on calculated cells, please refer to the CalculatedCellsApp bundled sample application.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Example:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"objective-c","code":["\/\/ Objective-C","cellActions.calculatedValue = ^NSObject*(SCTableViewCell *cell, NSIndexPath *indexPath)","{","    NSNumber *speed = [cell.boundObject valueForKey:@\"speed\"];","    NSNumber *distance = [cell.boundObject valueForKey:@\"distance\"];","    CGFloat time = 0;","    if([speed floatValue])","        time = [distance floatValue]\/[speed floatValue];","","    return [NSNumber numberWithFloat:time];","};"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCCellActions":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCCellActions","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"This class hosts a set of cell action blocks. Once an action is set to a desired code block, it will execute the block as soon as the action occurs.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/stv\/sccellactions","kind":"symbol","title":"SCCellActions","fragments":[{"text":"SCCellActions","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build data-driven UIKit table interfaces with Sensible TableView."}],"url":"\/documentation\/stv","role":"collection","title":"STV"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCCellActions/calculatedValue":{"title":"calculatedValue","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCCellActions\/calculatedValue","abstract":[{"text":"Action is used to provide a value for calculated cells.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/sccellactions\/calculatedvalue","fragments":[{"text":"calculatedValue","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCCellCalculatedValueAction_Block":{"title":"SCCellCalculatedValueAction_Block","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCCellCalculatedValueAction_Block","abstract":[{"text":"A block that calculates a value for a table-view cell.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/sccellcalculatedvalueaction_block","fragments":[{"text":"SCCellCalculatedValueAction_Block","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"}}}